### Next Experiment Planned: exp027 — TCN (Dilated CNN) AmpPredictor
- **What**: Replace GRU+Attention with WaveNet-style dilated convolutions (8 layers, dilations 1→128)
- **Why**: Fundamentally different inductive bias; multi-scale temporal modeling; 6x fewer parameters (~400K vs ~2.3M) → less overfitting
- **Expected**: Amp Corr 0.68-0.72, significantly reduced overfitting
- **Priority**: HIGH

